<title>USA: Pico realizes $18.5 million in stock sale.</title>
<headline>Pico realizes $18.5 million in stock sale.</headline>
<dateline>LA JOLLA, Calif. 1996-11-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>PICO Holdings Inc said it realized $18,499,303 from the sale of Fairfield Communities Inc stock by two of its subsidiaries.</p>
<p>Physicians Insurance Co of Ohio and American Physicians Life Insurance Co sold a total of 1,177,153 shares and underwriters have the option to purchase another 311,573 owned by Physicans Insurance Co of Ohio.</p>
